WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:01.890
And now, Great Moments

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:03.910
in Unintended Consequences.

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:05.800
Part one: The Yacht Plot.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.520
The year, 1990.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.610
The problem, a national debt that had exploded.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:14.940
The solution, a 10 percent luxury tax on expensive boats.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:18.190
Sounds like a great idea with the best of intentions.

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:20.283
What could possibly go wrong?

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:23.520
It turns out that while wealthy people buy yachts,

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.340
it's usually middle-income people who make them.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:28.410
This giant middle finger of a tax plan

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:31.040
cut sales of luxury boats by 70 percent,

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.790
sent companies overseas or into Chapter 11,

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:36.530
destroyed hundreds of thousands of middle class jobs,

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:39.830
and resulted in a net loss in tax revenue.

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:42.500
Turns out it was all for yacht.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.260
Part two: Who's Hungry Mao?

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.430
The year is 1958.

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:51.260
The problem, birds eating too much grain in China.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.190
The solution, Chairman Mao labels

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:56.600
the Eurasian sparrow as a capitalist enemy of the state,

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:00.910
kicking off a nationwide campaign to eradicate the species.

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:02.920
Sounds like an idea,

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:04.550
with the best of intentions!

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:06.878
What could possibly go wrong?

00:01:06.878 --> 00:01:09.380
It turns out sparrows also eat insects,

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.640
and insects eat a lot more grain than sparrows do.

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:14.410
100 million dead birds later,

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:16.540
grain yields plummeted in China,

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:19.880
resulting in massive famine, starvation, and deaths

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:24.090
estimated between 15 and 45 million people.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:26.830
On the bright side, at least China learned its lesson

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:29.000
about rounding up unwanted populat-

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.490
Part three: Vaccination Proclamations.

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:34.300
The year, 2021.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:37.100
The problem, effective distribution for a vaccine

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:38.820
with a short shelf life.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:42.090
New York's solution, create a massively detailed

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:44.020
yet questionable priority schedule.

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:46.290
Then mandate appointments, pushing applicants,

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:49.210
including the elderly, toward a buggy website

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.520
to answer lengthy questionnaires

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:53.020
and upload multiple attachments.

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:55.760
When that slows things down, find distribution centers

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:59.460
for giving about-to-expire doses to non-priority patients.

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:01.440
When they throw expired doses away,

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:04.760
fine them for not using their entire supply fast enough.

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:06.610
Also remove the priority status

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:08.960
of frontline workers who don't get it early enough

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:10.900
and threaten the strip medical licenses

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:12.480
and future vaccine delivery

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:15.170
for those who don't comply with all the rules created

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:17.320
and changed on a daily basis.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:20.180
Sounds like (groans).

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:22.000
Come on, New York, get it together.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.800
Just don't forget to cover up nursing home deaths

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:26.480
and blame the federal government

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:28.900
when you collect your Emmy!

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:31.640
Great Moments in Unintended Consequences.

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:33.803
Good intentions, bad results.

